      "created_at": "2025-12-04T03:24:11.880Z",
      "cooked": "<p>In the example image below, I’m a bit confused. Based on my understanding, the total outgoing value should be the sum of the Raw Materials in the document. However, while the total Raw Materials is 15,476, the total outgoing value shows 27,635.42. I’m trying to understand why there is such a difference.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/6/a6fbef9c9b8d201cf8c3263cd17943f9d0abb3df.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/a6fbef9c9b8d201cf8c3263cd17943f9d0abb3df\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/6/a6fbef9c9b8d201cf8c3263cd17943f9d0abb3df_2_586x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"nPd1T2Z2qtG8mtLhVILzrZ42Ii3\" width=\"586\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/6/a6fbef9c9b8d201cf8c3263cd17943f9d0abb3df_2_586x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/6/a6fbef9c9b8d201cf8c3263cd17943f9d0abb3df.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/6/a6fbef9c9b8d201cf8c3263cd17943f9d0abb3df.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"212121\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">796×679 39.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/pejay/{size}/67026_2.png",
